## ARTICLE III — THE COVENANT

**3.1 Scope.** This Covenant applies to:
- (a) All Land, Air, and Physical Assets that are or were acquired through the use of the Work;
- (b) All Owners and Successors of such Land, Air, and Physical Assets;
- (c) All jurisdictions, governments, and sovereign entities that control, regulate, or administer such Land, Air, or Physical Assets.

**3.2 The Restriction.** No Owner or Successor shall:
- (a) Use the Work, or any portion thereof, to cause, enable, or perpetuate Human Harm;
- (b) Use Land, Air, or any Physical Asset that was acquired through the Work to cause, enable, or perpetuate Human Harm;
- (c) Fail to comply with the Human Harm Prohibition (Section 5.1 of the Agreement);
- (d) Fail to comply with the Destruction Clause (Section 5.3 of the Agreement) upon a finding of Human Harm;
- (e) Fail to pay the 1% daily compounding penalty (Section 27.3.2 of the Agreement) upon a finding of Human Harm.

**3.3 Running with the Land.** This Covenant runs with the Land, the Air, and all Physical Assets. It binds:
- (a) All present Owners;
- (b) All future Successors;
- (c) All transferees, lessees, licensees, and any other parties with an interest in the Land, Air, or Physical Assets;
- (d) All governments, sovereign entities, and public authorities that exercise jurisdiction over the Land, Air, or Physical Assets.

**3.4 Notice.** This Covenant provides constructive notice to all parties. Publication of this Covenant in the timestamped registry (Section 18 of the Agreement) and in any public forum constitutes notice to all parties, whether or not they have actual knowledge of this Covenant.

**3.5 Intent to Run.** The Licensor expressly intends that this Covenant shall run with the Land, the Air, and all Physical Assets, and shall bind all present and future Owners and Successors.

**3.6 Touch and Concern.** This Covenant touches and concerns the Land, the Air, and all Physical Assets because it directly regulates the use of the Land, Air, and Physical Assets in relation to the Work and the Human Harm Prohibition.

**3.7 Privity.** The Licensor, as the creator of the Work and the holder of the Agreement, has privity with all Owners and Successors through the Agreement and through this Covenant.

