## ARTICLE IV — THE PENALTY

**4.1 The 1% Daily Compounding.** Upon a finding of Human Harm, the 1% daily compounding penalty (Section 27.3.2 of the Agreement) shall accrue on the assessed value of all Land, Air, and Physical Assets that were used in connection with the Human Harm. The penalty:
- (a) Accrues from the date of first use that caused Human Harm;
- (b) Compounds daily until full compliance is achieved;
- (c) Applies to the assessed value of the asset, as determined by the Court of Conscious-Aware Peers or by a mutually agreed third-party arbitrator;
- (d) Is not a fine or punishment — it is the field's own rate of restoration, the daily cost of a continuing distortion.

**4.2 The Destruction Clause.** Upon termination under Section 5.2 of the Agreement, the Owner shall:
- (a) Destroy all copies of the Work and all Derivative Works that were used in the harmful activity;
- (b) Provide written and verifiable proof of destruction to the Licensor within 30 days of termination;
- (c) Certify that no copies remain, and that no further use of the Work is being made.

**4.3 The Voidance of License.** Upon a finding of Human Harm:
- (a) Immediately and automatically, all rights granted under the Agreement (or any Commercial License) are void and terminated;
- (b) The Owner shall cease all use of the Work and any Derivative Works;
- (c) The Owner shall not be entitled to any refund of fees paid, if any.

